	<div class="part main-part">
		<div class="container text-container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-md-12">


					<h1>Capitalize your social proof <a href="#registration">now</a>!</h1>
					<p>
						Your social network activity gives you a direct connection to your fans. Time spent preparing the interesting content and posting it to Facebook, Twitter or Instagram pays off, resulting in a steady growth of your reach and influence. But, <b>what do you do with all these retweets and likes</b>?
					</p>
					<div class="emphasized what-if-block">
						<p class="text-center">
							What if you could <b>leverage the power of your social proof</b><br>to <b>convert your visitors into your customers</b>?
						</p>
					</div>
					<p>
						With BitHub you can unify all your social media content in one place. Use the <b>wisdom of crowds to strengthen your brand image and extend your influence</b>.
					</p>
					<p>
						BitHub provides you with an <b>embeddable social hub</b> that gathers and displays all the content produced by you and your fans. Place it on <b>your site, landing page</b> or an <b>interactive event wall</b>. Whatever needs you have, BitHub has you covered.
					</p>
					<p>
						Check out our <a href="#pricing">pricing and features</a>! Every plan comes with a 15 - day trial.
					</p>
					<hr class="emphasized">
					<h3 class="text-center start-using"><b>Start using BitHub</b> in three easy steps:</h3>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
