							<p>
								Every item we collect is automatically moderated based on the rules you set up. 
							</p>
							<p>
								You can block profanities or filter the data related to some subject. BitHub puts you in control of the data.
							</p>
							<p>
								Besides the automatic moderation, you can manually moderate any item.
							</p>
						</div>
						<div class="image-wrap">
							<img src="/site/images/approve_block.png" alt="">
